config BR2_PACKAGE_SVTJPEGXS
	bool "svtjpegxs"
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
	help
	  JPEG XS is an image and video codec that offers visually
	  and mathematically lossless quality. It is a special-purpose 
	  codec that is specifically designed to allow for low-complexity 
	  and low-latency implementations.

	  https://github.com/OpenVisualCloud/SVT-JPEG-XS

comment "SvtJpegXS needs a toolchain with thread support"
	depends on !BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
